        "title": "Rethinking GPS navigation: creating cognitive maps through auditory clues",
        "authors": "G. D. Clemenson, A. Maselli, A. J. Fiannaca et al.",
        "publication": "Scientific Reports 11, 7764 (2021)",
        "url": "https://doi.org/10.1038/s41598-021-87148-4"
